RUNPOD ROUTE

Role:
Elastic cloud GPU / AI compute chamber for AETHIEAOPSYS.

Authority:
AEUSB remains continuity authority.
RunPod provides rented execution surface only.

Use:
- GPU pods for containerized heavy workloads
- Serverless endpoints for burst inference
- Public endpoints for pre-deployed models
- Flash/local-to-remote functions where useful

Storage relation:
AE320GB holds local heavy body, models, mirrors, builds, and cache.
RunPod holds temporary or rented cloud execution state unless deliberately mirrored.

Rule:
No cloud provider becomes the body.
No runtime surface becomes authority.
Corp-O receipts all meaningful execution.
